# RENDER DASHBOARD REFERENCE — this file is NOT read by Render.
# Render static sites require headers to be set via Dashboard > Headers.
# This file documents the LIVE production configuration (validated 2026-02-21).
#
# IMPORTANT: Render does NOT support _headers files or /* wildcard for Cache-Control
# with precedence. Specific path rules MUST be ordered ABOVE general rules.
# Do NOT use /* for Cache-Control — it overrides all specific path rules.
#
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# SECURITY HEADERS (Path: /*) — 8 entries, all global
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# Path | Header Name                    | Value
# ─────┼────────────────────────────────┼──────────────────────────────────
# /*   | X-Content-Type-Options         | nosniff
# /*   | X-Frame-Options                | DENY
# /*   | Referrer-Policy                | strict-origin-when-cross-origin
# /*   | Permissions-Policy             | camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()
# /*   | Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy     | same-origin
# /*   | Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy   | same-origin
# /*   | Strict-Transport-Security      | max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains; preload
# /*   | Content-Security-Policy        | default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' https://js.stripe.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' https://res.cloudinary.com data: blob:; font-src 'self'; connect-src 'self' https://*.stripe.com https://api.cloudinary.com https://api.thesharedtablestory.com; frame-src https://js.stripe.com; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'
#
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# CACHE HEADERS — 6 entries (order matters: specific ABOVE general)
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# These MUST be ordered top-to-bottom in Render Dashboard exactly as shown.
# Render applies first match, not most-specific match.
#
# Path      | Header Name   | Value
# ──────────┼───────────────┼──────────────────────────────────
# /vendor/* | Cache-Control | public, max-age=31536000, immutable
# /js/*     | Cache-Control | public, max-age=31536000, immutable
# /css/*    | Cache-Control | public, max-age=31536000, immutable
# /assets/* | Cache-Control | public, max-age=31536000, immutable
# /*.html   | Cache-Control | no-store
# /         | Cache-Control | no-store
#
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# TOTAL: 14 entries in Render Dashboard
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# DEFENSE-IN-DEPTH (meta tags in all 25 HTML files):
#   - Content-Security-Policy (meta http-equiv)
#   - Referrer-Policy (meta name="referrer")
# These provide fallback enforcement alongside the Dashboard headers.
#
# PRODUCTION VALIDATION (2026-02-21):
#   / → no-store ✅ | /*.html → no-store ✅
#   /css/* → immutable ✅ | /js/* → immutable ✅ | /vendor/* → immutable ✅
#   CSP ✅ | HSTS ✅ | X-Frame-Options ✅ | nosniff ✅
#   COOP ✅ | CORP ✅ | Permissions-Policy ✅ | Referrer-Policy ✅
